      "description": "Live camera template: disabled. Configure local ROS runtime (docs/ros2.md), domain 71, localhost, /opencv_dataflow/camera/image, best-effort/volatile QoS. Enable camera and use Continuous after a peer is ready. One acquired sample per cycle. No ROS image or robot connection is embedded in this project.",
      "parameters": {},
